Query: "Search query: Rulebook - Insight check for Dorian (DC 13) during interaction with Old Tomas at dawn in Ravenmoor"


Rulebook search result for 'Insight check for Dorian (DC 13) during interaction with Old Tomas at dawn in Ravenmoor':

According to the rulebook, to make an Insight check, the player rolls a d20 and adds the relevant ability score modifier. In this case, it would be Dorian's Wisdom modifier (Wis 16 gives a +3 modifier). So, Dorian would roll a d20 and add +3.

Refer to the Ravenloft Core Rulebook - 'Chapter 4: Ability Scores and Modifiers', page 87 for more details.

